# Revision 2 (owner request, 2026-10-07, docs/phase-nav-brief.md): the
# transitions-review.mp4 owner-round video: push and pop split -> split
# (main menu <-> Music) and split -> full-screen (Music <-> Songs), and
# the Clocks reveal or its stub (D6: Extras pushes like any other split
# -> full target in v1, since nothing wires UI_T_REVEAL to a real caller
# this phase -- see ipodui-nav-reveal.script). Pins the clock and
# battery; "record" is called right after each key press (it does not
# block the UI thread, so the slide it captures is the one the key just
# started) and repeated with the SAME name, so every burst lands in one
# continuous clip (uisimulator/common/sim_cmd_record.c).
#
# Owner round, Revision 3 (2026-10-08): "# drift: live" (IPODUI_SIM_DRIFT,
# apps/ipodui/preview.c) lets the main menu's Music panel drift instead of
# staying frozen, and "title_phase auto" (uisimulator/common/sim_cmd_clock.c)
# lets the header alternate title/clock (2 s / 4 s) instead of staying
# frozen on the title, so the video shows both live behaviors while moving
# through the menus. The Music rest after the second pop (back to the main
# menu) is stretched to 13 s -- one continuous recorded span, so it alone
# covers more than two 6 s title/clock cycles and several drift steps.
#
# Produce the video after running this (scripts/make_video.sh,
# Revision 2):
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-nav-transitions-review.script
#   scripts/make_video.sh \
#       out/shots/ipodui-nav-transitions-review/transitions-review_frames \
#       24 out/shots/transitions-review.mp4
# needs: library
# drift: live

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
wait_db 30000
time_in_title on    # Time in Title defaults to Off (Phase 11); this script needs the header clock
sim_clock 15:08
clock_format 24
battery 100
title_phase auto
shot boot

# split -> split: main menu <-> Music (190 ms each way, D7)
key SELECT 50
record 900 24 transitions-review
wait 300
key MENU 50
record 900 24 transitions-review
wait 300

# split -> full-screen: Music <-> Songs (push 250 ms, pop 290 ms, D7)
key SELECT 50        # Music
record 900 24 transitions-review
wait 300
wheel +3             # "Songs"  [Compilations off: P11]
wait 400
key SELECT 50
record 900 24 transitions-review
wait 300
key MENU 50          # pop: Songs -> Music
record 1000 24 transitions-review
wait 300
key MENU 50          # pop: Music -> the main menu
record 13000 24 transitions-review  # rest: Music panel drifts, header
                                     # cycles title/clock more than twice
wait 300

# the Clocks reveal stub (D6): Extras, a plain push in v1
wheel +2             # "Extras"
wait 400
key SELECT 50
record 900 24 transitions-review
wait 300
key MENU 50
record 900 24 transitions-review

quit
